  "runtimeAssetStrategy": "All map-card cover art is embedded in index.html as data URLs so cards do not rely on relative asset paths. Domination area screenshots are reserved for later uploads; each area has a separate direct HTTPS 2D floor-plan URL hosted by rivals.gs, so 2D views require access to that source.",
