    "mapPointAssignments": "Central Park uses the supplied Dracula A/B/C images; Hall of Djalia uses HALL OF DJALIA 1 and HALL 2/3; Symbiotic Surface uses Klyntar 1/2/3; Heart of Heaven uses Kunlun 1/2/3; Shin-Shibuya uses SHIN SHIBUYA 1/2 and SHIN 3; Lower Manhattan uses Lower Manhattan 1/2/3.",
    "pointImageFormat": "All 18 uploaded Convoy point screenshots are optimized JPEG files and are embedded in index.html with static copies under assets/maps/.",
    "museumOfContemplation2D": "A verified top-down level-geometry plan is available from https://rivals.gs/maps/museum-of-contemplation/ and is loaded from https://rivals.gs/img/layouts/museume01.webp.",
    "convoyPointAssignments": "Arakko 1/2/3, Midtown 1/2/3, Museum 1/2/3, Spider-Islands 1/2/3, Thebes 1/2/3 and Yggdrasil 1/2/3 are assigned in upload order to Points A/B/C.",
    "dominationPool": "Competitive Domination entries: Royal Palace, Birnin T’Challa, Hell’s Heaven, Krakoa, Celestial Husk and God Quarry. Each has three numbered area controls. Each number has a 2D layout button beneath it; numbered main-view screenshot slots remain available for user screenshots.",
    "dominationSubmapNames": "Royal Palace: Odin’s Archive, Bifrost Garden, Throne Room; Birnin T’Challa: Stellar Spaceport, Imperial Institute of Science, Warrior Falls; Hell’s Heaven: Frozen Airfield, Super-Soldier Factory, Eldritch Monument; Krakoa: Cradle, The Grove, Carousel; Celestial Husk: Celestial Hand, Celestial Codex, Celestial Vault; God Quarry: Halls of All-Knowing, House of Ideas, Confessional Eternity.",
    "domination2DLayouts": "The app references the published top-down image URLs on rivals.gs: asgardc01–03 (Royal Palace), wakandac01–03 (Birnin T’Challa), hydrac01–03 (Hell’s Heaven), krakoac01–03 (Krakoa), klyntarc01–03 (Celestial Husk), godquarryc01–03 (God Quarry). These are remote HTTPS images, not binaries bundled in the ZIP."
